    "detailed_description": "It was a dark and stormy night when the helicopter had to make an emergency landing on an isolated island. Unfortunately for them, fate had a cruel twist in store. As the storm progressed, the chopper was violently tossed and turned until it landed on an isolated island shrouded in mystery.<br><br>You will have to make a distress signal but this will surely attract the cannibals to you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Build a safe place using natural resources such as wood and minerals</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Loot re-spawns after some time, so make sure you make some runs through the map</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Find and create guns and weapons</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Hunt animals for food and crafting materials</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Find a way out of the island</strong></h2>",
